{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1000_038chz", "source_sha256": "967ff140ae61fb13ae43747d2ea5fcbf8470e8b2744d061274ede003792e8893", "ja": "うう、ちゃんとセレブらしく見えるかしら？\nああ、わたくし、なぜあんなことを……！", "zh": "呜呜，看起来真的有名流的风范吗？\n啊啊，我到底为什么会做出那种事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1001_p", "source_sha256": "850242157298d33a64842817359b0b387291300e619a528e8fbbe1adbe7249c3", "ja": "お疲れ様です。\n……千鶴さん、どうかしましたか？", "zh": "辛苦了。\n……千鹤，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "c2eb645a619a1d0bdf8efaef2d5dc06107c58a4117874e61207ff84761ef31b5", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。ちょうどいいところに。\n少し意見を聞かせてくださいますか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。您来得正好。\n可以听听您的意见吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e322c69bef460facf4a960851a4365b8b123c7a5abb5af5bb97b0b18e013e22d", "ja": "もちろんです。どんな内容ですか？", "zh": "当然可以。是什么事情呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "cdd7c2b25fe66f4375c4ae447f6ed970b22af6a15bdf6fe4542dbb8c463b1a56", "ja": "それが……劇場の小さい子たちに、「いつも\nどんな服を着ているのか」と言われまして……。", "zh": "那个……剧场里的小孩子们问我：“您平时都穿什么样的衣服？”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1005_p", "source_sha256": "74dc8420126fdc7f7571c59d3e6d02348deba504ec49df1e0a834738060b87a9", "ja": "なるほど。みんな、\n千鶴さんのファッションに興味があるんですね。", "zh": "原来如此。大家都对千鹤小姐的穿搭很感兴趣呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "e5035aabf1b7a2644cb2b2c079757efe8d0c5aa5cdfdd37f53a3f699b314d200", "ja": "ええ。今日は少し気合いを入れてきたのですが……\n{$P$}から見て、如何ですか？", "zh": "是的。今天特意稍微打扮了一下……从{$P$}先生的角度来看，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b88241118fbc1efe1d0d5de0b00a9e6a92e6cb74e5987b7687be57d9506b5a06", "ja": "そうですね……。\n千鶴さんらしくて、とても似合ってますよ！", "zh": "嗯……很有千鹤小姐的风格，非常适合您哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "f7e05dcd48c63eab775499317ff2129c50d47ce925060952bb195faa39e068fa", "ja": "ほ、本当に……？", "zh": "真、真的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a34eac863cc540946350e5c5445e318a2196a0aaa4348fef5da462f3645fb805", "ja": "はい。バッチリです！\n綺麗な千鶴さんを見たら、みんなも喜びますよ。", "zh": "是的，完全没问题！\n大家看到美丽的千鹤小姐，也会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "53628454bfe078bc74fa5ac19f67d84938a189b5417d808883417fffb4a9460c", "ja": "はあ～。安心しましたわ……。実は、\nみんなが、がっかりしないか気がかりだったのです。", "zh": "哈啊～这下放心了……其实，我一直担心大家会不会失望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "5bdad5ef108552f5bddfc43bd4ed70f43eca62d6d9f927adb3444984cffa2c13", "ja": "もっとセレブでゴージャスな服装を\nわたくしに期待しているのではないかと思って……。", "zh": "我还以为大家会期待我穿得\n更加名流、更加奢华呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a7c5e838a93309307f68478a3bee2aee760496da7e5dd77c9d9b470dc79fb1bf", "ja": "たしかに……。『セレブの服装』と聞くと、\nそういうイメージですね。", "zh": "确实……一听到“名媛的服装”，\n就会有那样的印象呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "da1caf052441892162c3d751fc3d731f53172c9a073f87b537cc0ee624d949dc", "ja": "うっ、や、やっぱり……。", "zh": "呃、果、果然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1014_p", "source_sha256": "23bd0535284790b132648813c5a1b0a2830a5681f5a3214edb3472ff7456b1a6", "ja": "でも、みんなが知りたいのは『セレブの服装』ではなく\n『千鶴さんの服装』なんだと思います。", "zh": "不过，我想大家想知道的并不是“名媛的穿着”，而是“千鹤小姐的穿着”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "29f85b01e1374ae8416898a889783dac3909c2e1632b163bc14f86c09a4bd0ce", "ja": "それは……ええと、つまり……。\nわたくし自身に興味がある、ということでしょうか？", "zh": "那就是说……呃，也就是……大家对我本人感兴趣，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1016_p", "source_sha256": "3837eae7e28c382f34af3e0033db59ba8a61f72a95ee0d72c319f3357fbee763", "ja": "そうです。みんな千鶴さんが好きですからね。\n千鶴さんの好みやセンスを知りたいんです。", "zh": "是的。因为大家都喜欢千鹤小姐嘛。想了解千鹤小姐的喜好和品味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1017_038chz", "source_sha256": "6dcf68b57d66705ea51dfcbc1644f3005fad4051944633381bacfb5d58468d1a", "ja": "……なるほど。\n親しい相手ほど、いろいろと知りたくなりますものね。", "zh": "……原来如此。\n越是亲近的人，就越会想了解对方的方方面面呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "ab2fda73218d884609cfe686fd3cee56146e90bf24f507b6ca87dca628727b42", "ja": "ありがとうございます。{$P$}の\nおかげで、このままでいいのだと気づきましたわ。", "zh": "谢谢您。多亏了{$P$}，\n我才意识到像现在这样就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "b9de0c8860eff0f57ed13d3c5ef76833114c62ea34bba99bc14baa623881fcee", "ja": "なぜこの服を選んだのか……。\n胸を張って、みなさんにお話ししてきます。", "zh": "我为什么会选择这件衣服……  \n我会昂首挺胸地向大家讲述。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1020_p", "source_sha256": "40f1aa49805c5c3ff9419194c7b4c8bbd0b6a239564cf2b91d217a54ef790306", "ja": "はい。普段の千鶴さんの魅力を、\nたくさん伝えてください。", "zh": "好的。请把千鹤平时的魅力，\n充分传达给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "33abeb52f4609af92775d9221c4e4b6c05b1f6d22d639f55bdc05f8d6db84f50", "ja": "ええ！　お礼と言ってはなんですが……。今度、\n{$P$}の服を見に行きましょう。", "zh": "是的！说是答谢，其实也算不上什么……下次去看看{$P$}的衣服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0414_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "02388d8ce2ba3b4cc2d4afd2537da4cf915ff25183ad78be43b44fee191fcb8c", "ja": "その時は、{$P$}の好みを\nたくさん教えてくださいな。ふふっ♪", "zh": "到那时候，请多告诉我一些{$P$}喜欢的风格吧。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
